{"product_id":"birdy","title":"Birdy","description":"\u003cp\u003eTwo teenagers form an unlikely friendship in pre-War Philadelphia. Al is obsessed with lifting weights, looking good and chasing girls. Birdy is obsessed with flight. Birdy's passion becomes all-encompassing. Birdy wants to fly. A few years later these young men find themselves emotionally and physically scarred by Word War Two. Al is called to an army psychiatric hospital to help the doctors there treat his friend, who he finds squatting on the floor of his cell and acting like a bird. \u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:20 x 200  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: William Wharton \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9780007457984 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format: paperback \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 300\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43548701458585,"sku":"14RA9780007457984","price":20.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/y648.jpg?v=1761235986","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/birdy","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}